	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Controls the Pomodoro menu bar app (https://github.com/rallevondalle/macos-pomodoro) through its CLI.

pomo                     status and the main actions
pomo start               start / pause / resume
pomo break 25            25 min break (pomo pause 25 works too)
pomo lunch               lunch break (frokost)
pomo focus dyb           deep focus (classic/klassisk, deep/dyb, flow)
pomo skip · stop · panel
pomo screen              cycle the break screen: deep → all → off

Needs Pomodoro.app in /Applications or ~/Applications.</string>
